Z||000001||Blacktree||12-16-2001||12:48 AM||||That's a cool idea. In Gran Turismo 2, the Stratos was one of my favorite cars. It seems that the basic design and drivetrain layout are very similar to the Fiero (or maybe vice versa since the Stratos is an older car?). I would imagine that due to the similarities of the 2 cars, one could make a very convincing Stratos kit body. And since the Stratos also had a small-displacement V6, you could even make your Fiero <B>sound</B> and <B>perform</B> like a Stratos!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tweaktech.com" TARGET=_blank>Tweaktech</A>||||reg||1
