Z||000006||Archie||12-16-2001||09:10 AM||||Yeah, I like the Stratos. There is a company in the U.K. that makes a replica of it on a tube chassis, very nice.<P>Here are a couple of pics. of a real one. I took these pics in 2000 at the Carlisle show. I saw this car driving accross a field and ran like 20 minutes to catch up with it.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-209s_2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-207s_1.jpg"> <P>You get one of those bodies and I'll make it fit a Fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Archie<P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?||||reg||1
