Z||000009||Jay||12-16-2001||01:55 PM||||Lancia Stratos, designed by Bertone for Lancia and uses the 2.4 litre Ferrari V6 engine mated to a 5 speed transaxle.  As  mentioned there are several UK companies that make this kit but not on a Fiero.  You can also get them with the real Ferrari engine.  The 2.4 V6 engine was available in the Lancia Stratos (Bertone), the Fiat Dino Coupe (Bertone), Fiat Dino Spyder (Pininfarina) and the Ferrari Dino (Pininfarina).  Tough to find replacement parts for the engine.  One of the best ralley cars of all time!<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
